# Arlo

> Arlo designs AI-powered smart home security: wireless and wired security cameras, video doorbells, floodlight cameras, and whole-home security systems. The product catalog and checkout live at https://us.arlo.com (Shopify storefront); the marketing home page lives at https://www.arlo.com.

## About

- Brand: Arlo Smart Home Security
- Categories: security cameras, video doorbells, floodlight cameras, home security systems, accessories, security subscriptions
- Subscription: Arlo Secure plan (AI alerts, 30-day video history, activity zones, emergency response, object detection) — starts at $7.99/month.
- Key technologies: AI-powered detection, up to 4K video, smart-home integrations (Apple HomeKit, Amazon Alexa, Google Assistant), industry-leading privacy.

